config APP_HUBPROGRAM
	tristate "Brickwright autonomous program and MicroPython runner"
	default n
	depends on LEGO_PORT && LEGO_LUMP
	---help---
		Runs bounded Brickwright instruction programs and embedded MicroPython
		inside NuttX using the real LEGO port drivers. hubprogram packet HEX
		provides the USB NSH transport; btsensor serves the same service over BLE.
		The current robot API controls A/B motors and C/D/E sensor predicates.
		The VM has a 32 KiB heap, 16 KiB worker stack and 120 second timeout.
